  "description": "This content is a brand webtoon produced by the Cultural Heritage Administration, featuring promotional webtoons created by 10 Naver artists to encourage visits to national heritage sites. Stories of national heritage encountered along the way. We invite you to explore our national heritage itineraries.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\nStories Included:\n1. **Biguniui Nampyeon** (비구니의 남편) \\[Nong-Gu Bang\\]\n2. **Isunsin Janggunnim, Ibeon Saengeun Jeulgiseyo!** (이순신 장군님, 이번 생은 즐기세요!) \\[Jyabachip\\]\n3. **Geumbichyeohaeng** (금빛여행) \\[Loro\\]\n4. **2-beonjjae Myeoljong** (2번째 멸종) \\[OSIK\\]\n5. **Sejaui Chiteukineun Yuryeongnim!** (세자의 치트키는 유령님!) \\[Byeolppang\\]\n6. **Boseuneun Hoho Halmeoni** (보스는 호호 할머니) \\[Gyu-Ing\\]\n7. **Baengmieumsik** (백미음식) \\[Cooljamong\\]\n8. **Neoege Danneun Love Track** (너에게 닿는 러브트랙) \\[Ul-So Seo\\]\n9. **Gayagobunbuntugi** (가야고분분투기) \\[AHN\\]\n10. **Sajeogin Romance** (사적인 로맨스) \\[Yoni Yoni\\]",
